BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lift-20261005@training-tracker
DTSTAMP:20260930T223359Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261005T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261005T183000
SUMMARY:Session A\, week 1
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: Ramp in. Stop every set with 3 reps left. Week 1 is 2 s
 ets\, 3 sets from week 2.\n\nWarm up: Wall walk out 2 x 10 sec\; Band shou
 lder exercise 2 sets\, shoulder blade and chin back\; Standing row 2.5 kg\
 , 1 x 10 with 6 sec hold\; Band hip abduction\, 3 steps each side x 2\; Ta
 ble top leg extensions\, 1 set to fatigue\; Ramp up set: 1 easy set at hal
 f the working weight\n\nGoblet squat: 2 x 8-12\nOne arm DB row: 2 x 8-12 e
 ach\nDB floor press\, neutral grip: 2 x 8-12\nDB Romanian deadlift: 2 x 8-
 12\nBand pull apart: 2 x 12-15\nTable top leg extension: 2 x max\n\nLog ev
 ery set in the Training app.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Session A\, week 1
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
